# Generated cross-repo fixture. Its bytes are COPIED verbatim into
# hermes-smd-overlay tests/contract/seat_gate_binding_snapshot.json, so the
# emitter (tests/gate-coverage-snapshot.test.ts, JSON.stringify with 2-space
# indent) owns the formatting, not prettier. Prettier collapses the short
# excluded_template_dirs array onto one line; the overlay's merged fixture has
# it expanded, and a formatter rewriting a generated file makes the drift test
# permanently red. The sibling gate-coverage-snapshot.json is NOT exempt — it
# has no short arrays, so the two formatters already agree on it.
operator/contracts/gate-coverage-snapshot.overlay.json
