# Generated Settlement Closeout proving data (ss #2455). render_seed.py emits
# both the keying sheet a person works from and the canned layout payloads the
# offline tests run against, and operator/tests/test_closeout_seed.py asserts
# a re-render is byte-identical to what is committed. A formatter rewriting
# either artifact makes that determinism test permanently red, and the whole
# point of single-sourcing them is that the sandbox and the fixtures cannot
# disagree. Same rationale as gate-coverage-snapshot.overlay.json above: the
# emitter owns the formatting.
